    },
    "body": "Follows up on #901 and #955.\n\n`importdescriptors` and `descriptorprocesspsbt` accept output descriptors that can contain BIP32 extended private keys (`xprv`) or WIF private keys, similar to `addhdkey` and `signrawtransactionwithkey`, but their arguments were still retained in the Qt RPC console command history.\n\nAdd `descriptorprocesspsbt` and `importdescriptors` to `historyFilter` in `src/qt/rpcconsole.cpp` and cover both in `src/qt/test/rpcnestedtests.cpp` (`RPCNestedTests::rpcNestedTests`).",
