      "message": "qt: filter descriptor RPCs from console history\n\nimportdescriptors and descriptorprocesspsbt accept output descriptors\ncontaining extended private keys or WIF private keys, similar to\naddhdkey and signrawtransactionwithkey, but their arguments were\npreviously retained in RPC console history.\n\nAdd both commands to historyFilter and cover them in rpcnestedtests.",
